# Real pairing secrets. wh-mini writes its pairings to --pairs, which
# defaults to wh-pairs.txt in the working directory: run it from the repo and
# a genuine 32-byte secret lands here. The apps keep theirs outside the repo
# (private directory, Keystore, safeStorage) and never in a file like this.
wh-pairs.txt
**/wh-pairs.txt
pairs.txt

# Symbian self-signed development certificate (never commit)
packages/app-symbian/sis/portalgems-dev.key
packages/app-symbian/sis/portalgems-dev.cer
packages/app-symbian/sis/*.sis
packages/app-symbian/sis/whmini.exe
packages/app-symbian/sis/*.rsc
packages/app-symbian/sis/*.mbm
packages/app-symbian/sis/dist/

docs/feat.txt

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
